1	/**
2	 * Feature Done Watcher (T4).
3	 *
4	 * Poll step that automatically transitions `feature_status` from `in_handoff`
5	 * to `done` when all feature PRs are merged.
6	 *
7	 * Steps per feature:
8	 *   1. Read status.yaml — skip if feature_status !== "in_handoff".
9	 *   2. Read handoff_pr_url and impl_feature_prs from status.yaml.
10	 *   3. Call GitHub REST API to check merge state for each PR.
11	 *   4. All PRs merged →
12	 *      a. Checkout feature/{id} (still alive); write feature_status: done +
13	 *         current_stage: done; commit + push to feature/{id}.
14	 *      b. Auto-merge workspace_feature_pr_url (squash) if present and mergeable.
15	 *      c. Emit feature_done.
16	 *   5. impl_feature_prs absent or empty → check only handoff_pr_url;
17	 *      emit impl_feature_prs_missing.
18	 *   6. GitHub API error → emit feature_done_check_failed; continue (non-fatal).
19	 */
